    WHEN `s 278.14(2)(g) society's interest in encouraging the obtaining of treatment by complainants of sexual offences` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the judge "shall take the following factors into account"
    WHEN `s 278.14(2)(h) the effect of the determination on the integrity of the trial process` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the judge "shall take the following factors into account"

