    IF `the accused seeks production of a record or therapeutic record referred to in subsection 278.2(1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An accused who seeks production of a record or therapeutic record referred to in subsection 278.2(1) must make an application for its production to the judge before whom the accused is to be, or is being, tried"

