-- COVERS[encoded]: s 278.21(3); s 278.21(3)(a); s 278.21(3)(b); s 278.21(3)(c)
-- src:5429 | Form and content
-- src:5430 | (3) The application must be made in writing and must set out
@ref Criminal Code s 278.21(3) (src:5429-5430)
GIVEN `the application is made in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application sets out particulars identifying the record or the therapeutic record that the accused seeks to have produced` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the thing sought is a therapeutic record` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the case of a record, the application sets out the grounds on which the accused relies to establish that the record is likely relevant to an issue at trial or to the competence of a witness to testify` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the case of a therapeutic record, the application sets out the grounds on which the accused relies to establish that the therapeutic record contains evidence that could raise a reasonable doubt as to the accused's guilt` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 278.21(3) the application meets the requirements of form and content` MEANS
    IF     `the application is made in writing`
       AND `the application sets out particulars identifying the record or the therapeutic record that the accused seeks to have produced`
       AND (IF `the thing sought is a therapeutic record`
            THEN `in the case of a therapeutic record, the application sets out the grounds on which the accused relies to establish that the therapeutic record contains evidence that could raise a reasonable doubt as to the accused's guilt`
            ELSE `in the case of a record, the application sets out the grounds on which the accused relies to establish that the record is likely relevant to an issue at trial or to the competence of a witness to testify`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The application must be made in writing and must set out"

-- The subsection is word for word s 278.12(4): the same list, the same function.
