-- src:5522 | (a) an offence under section 151, 152, 153, 153.1, 155, 160, 170, 171, 172, 173, 213, 271, 272, 273, 279.01, 279.011, 279.02, 279.03, 286.1, 286.2 or 286.3 or any other offence under this Act, or any other Act of Parliament, that is of a sexual nature or that is committed for a sexual purpose; or
